```
```
  cap t192-restored-eth4.pcap: 21 frame(s)
    x4   ICMP t0/c0 10.38.22.66 -> 10.38.22.65   [ours]     <- .66 answers again
    x4   ICMP t3/c1 10.38.22.66 -> 10.38.22.65   [ours]     <- .70 unreachable, FROM .66
    x3   ARP-REQ who-has 10.38.22.70 tell 10.38.22.66
```
Back to leg A exactly. **The arc on the wire: `.66` -> `.70` -> (cold boot) `.70` -> `.66`.**

